---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Wenu Mapu"
  description="Privacy policy for Wenu Mapu. What data we collect, how we use it, and your rights."
>
  <section class="section section--mega">
    <div class="container legal">
      <p class="eyebrow">LEGAL · PRIVACY</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: May 2026</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you order, we collect your name, shipping address, email and phone (only when needed for delivery). When you submit a commission inquiry or newsletter signup, we collect your email and the details you write to us. When you visit the site, our hosting provider may log your IP and browser for security and analytics.</p>

      <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To process and ship your order</li>
        <li>To respond to your commission inquiry</li>
        <li>To send the ritual newsletter you signed up for (you can unsubscribe any time)</li>
        <li>To improve site performance and prevent abuse</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We don't sell your data to anyone</li>
        <li>We don't share your data with advertising networks</li>
        <li>We don't run third-party trackers beyond what's strictly needed for the site to function</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Third parties we use</h2>
      <p>Our store runs on WooCommerce. Payments are processed by Stripe and PayPal. Shipping uses USPS and DHL. Newsletter (if you subscribe) is sent through our email provider. Each of these has their own privacy policy and we only share with them what they need to do their job.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use only essential cookies — for cart, login, and basic site function. We don't use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can request a copy of your data, ask us to delete it, or unsubscribe from emails any time. Write to marimari@wenumapuonline.com.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Our site is not directed to children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect data from them.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy meaningfully, we'll post an update here with a new "last updated" date.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
